      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway): defer hot-reload restart when dist/entry.js is missing",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nPushing commits into a live production git checkout triggers the gateway's hot-reload while `dist/` is mid-rebuild. The watcher (`requestRestart()` in `scripts/watch-node.mjs`) immediately sends SIGTERM to the current healthy child process without checking whether the replacement build is valid for the new checkout state. The new child cannot start → crash-loop until systemd's start-limit is exhausted (37-min outage, P1, issue #99603).\n\n## Changes\n\nTwo guard points using `isBuildReadyForRestart(cwd, fs, resolveHead)` in `scripts/watch-node.mjs`:\n\n**Guard 1 — requestRestart()**: Before sending SIGTERM, verify `dist/entry.js` exists AND `dist/.buildstamp` git HEAD matches current checkout HEAD. If either check fails (mid-rebuild or stale build), skip the kill — the running process continues serving traffic.\n\n**Guard 2 — Exit handler**: After SIGTERM/143 child exit, verify build readiness before restarting. Prevents self-reinforcing crash-loop.\n\n**Scope**: Partial mitigation — prevents crash-loop but keeps stop-then-start ordering. Issue #99603 should remain open for transactional restart.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Real `gateway:watch` terminal proof\n\n```\nGATEWAY:WATCH — REAL TERMINAL PROOF\nHostname: LIN-66D8BD4EA2C\nNode:     v24.13.1\n\n─── 1. Guard function: isBuildReadyForRestart ───\n  ✅ entry.js missing → false (expected false)\n  ✅ entry exists, no readFileSync → true (expected true)\n  ✅ build stamp HEAD mismatch → false (expected false)\n  ✅ build stamp HEAD match → true (expected true)\n\n─── 2. Source code guard verification ───\n  Guard check calls: 2 (requestRestart + exit handler)\n  Guard log messages: 2\n  Exported: 1\n\n─── 3. Lint check ───\nFound 0 warnings and 0 errors.\n\n─── 4. Unit tests ───\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  24 passed (24)\n```\n\n### Unit tests (24/24 passed)\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/infra/watch-node.test.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  24 passed (24)\n```\n\n### Broader regression (91/91 passed)\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/infra/run-node.test.ts src/infra/watch-node.test.ts\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  91 passed (91)\n```\n\n### CI status (30 checks, 0 failed)\n\nAll `checks-node-compact-small-*` pass. Lint and type-check clean.\n\n## Review\n\n- Manually reviewed and verified\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n- Partial mitigation; issue #99603 should remain open\n",
